// Oren native runtime (native backend) — core profile
//
// Goal (rolling):
// - Provide a smaller injected runtime surface for typical programs so a cold runtime-object build
//   stays bounded (<10s) even when the rtobj seed/cache is empty.
// - Keep the full runtime available via `lib/runtime_native.oren` (default profile).
//
// Notes:
// - Include order remains semantically significant for the runtime.
// - This profile intentionally excludes heavier subsystems:
//   - typed numeric buffers (HPC/SIMD surfaces)
//   - TCP/UDP/select networking surfaces
//   - AVM bridge
//   - `oren_net_get` helper (depends on TCP surface)
//   - SHA-256 helpers (used by AVM/tooling; kept in full runtime)
//
// Edit the runtime sources under `lib/runtime_native/*.oren`.

